{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Business Insider報道，物理超智能實驗室Physical Superintelligence（PSI）稱，其利用一款尚未公開的Anthropic模型，在3天內找到了量子計算領域「阿倫森—安拜尼斯猜想」的證明。該猜想自2008年提出以來一直懸而未決，涉及量子計算機在何種情況下能夠大幅快於傳統計算機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585450.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.657324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:08:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"fd1ca361208f3678995198c5c7d7f3e6486f7c174fd67cf24c9e7c163d8caf74","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}